  <description>
    <p>This is a community package of Voltius, maintained independently and unaffiliated with the Voltius project. It repackages the official upstream .deb unmodified and follows upstream releases automatically.</p>
    <p>Voltius is a local-first SSH, SFTP and serial client — an open-source alternative to Termius. Hosts, keys and identities live in an encrypted vault that you can sync end-to-end encrypted through storage you own.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>SSH terminals with split panes and input broadcast; sessions that survive disconnects and restarts.</li>
      <li>SFTP between hosts and your machine, with drag and drop.</li>
      <li>End-to-end encrypted sync through a GitHub Gist, a Cloudflare Worker or any S3-compatible bucket.</li>
      <li>One-click import from Termius and MobaXterm; export as open JSON.</li>
      <li>Docker and Proxmox LXC management, a process manager and live host stats.</li>
      <li>Plugins, and an optional local MCP server for AI coding tools.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Permissions: this package follows the upstream .deb. It grants network access, the GPU, the Secret Service for stored credentials, your ssh-agent, your home folder (for <code>~/.ssh</code> and the local side of SFTP) and all devices (for serial ports). From the release after 0.42.0, the local terminal tab opens your login shell on the host system through <code>flatpak-spawn --host</code>, which gives it the same access as a terminal outside the sandbox.</p>
  </description>
